-- Phase 4 U2: TicketRequest waitlist model, admin audit trail, and the
-- request→ticket back-link. SQL generated by `prisma migrate diff` so it
-- matches Prisma's conventions exactly (avoids future drift noise).
--
-- The tickets.ticket_request_id FK is ON DELETE SET NULL on purpose: deleting
-- a TicketRequest must never cascade-delete an issued, paid Ticket — the Ticket
-- is the durable artifact, the request is only provenance. The one-open-request
-- partial unique index is Prisma-inexpressible and lands in the NEXT migration
-- (add_ticket_request_partial_unique), which must stay last.

